  </article>\n\n      <article class=\"tool-card\">\n        <div class=\"tool-heading\"><span class=\"number\">5</span><span>钢丝钳</span></div>\n        <div class=\"product pliers\" aria-label=\"钢丝钳图片\">[工具图片]</div>\n        <div class=\"tool-text\">\n          <p><b>用途：</b>夹持、弯曲、剪切导线</p>\n          <p><b>用法：</b>用钳口夹持物体，需剪切时用靠近铰链处的刀口。</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"tool-card\">\n        <div class=\"tool-heading\"><span class=\"number\">6</span><span>尖嘴钳</span></div>\n        <div class=\"product pliers\" aria-label=\"尖嘴钳图片\">[工具图片]</div>\n        <div class=\"tool-text\">\n          <p><b>用途：</b>夹持小件、弯折导线</p>\n          <p><b>用法：</b>用钳尖夹持小件，适合在狭小空间操作。</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"tool-card\">\n        <div class=\"tool-heading\"><span class=\"number\">7</span><span>斜口钳</span></div>\n        <div class=\"product pliers\" aria-label=\"斜口钳图片\">[工具图片]</div>\n        <div class=\"tool-text\">\n          <p><b>用途：</b>剪切导线、铜丝等</p>\n          <p><b>用法：</b>将导线放入钳口，用力握紧即可剪断。</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"tool-card\">\n        <div class=\"tool-heading\"><span class=\"number\">8</span><span>剥线钳</span></div>\n        <div class=\"product pliers\" aria-label=\"剥线钳图片\">[工具图片]</div>\n        <div class=\"tool-text\">\n          <p><b>用途：</b>剥离导线绝缘层</p>\n          <p><b>用法：</b>根据导线规格选择剥线口，夹紧后旋转或轻压剥离。</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"tool-card\">\n        <div class=\"tool-heading\"><span class=\"number\">9</span><span>电工刀</span></div>\n        <div class=\"product\" aria-label=\"电工刀图片\">[工具图片]</div>\n        <div class=\"tool-text\">\n          <p><b>用途：</b>剥线、削绝缘层</p>\n          <p><b>用法：</b>刀口朝外，轻划绝缘层，切勿用力过猛以免伤到导线。</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"tool-card\">\n        <div class=\"tool-heading\"><span class=\"number\">10</span><span>卷尺</span></div>\n        <div class=\"product meter\" aria-label=\"卷尺图片\">[工具图片]</div>\n        <div class=\"tool-text\">\n          <p><b>用途：</b>测量长度</p>\n          <p><b>用法：</b>拉出尺带，勾住测量起点，读取刻度。</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"tool-card\">\n        <div class=\"tool-heading\"><span class=\"number\">11</span><span>绝缘胶带</span></div>\n        <div class=\"product tape\" aria-label=\"绝缘胶带图片\">[工具图片]</div>\n        <div class=\"tool-text\">\n          <p><b>用途：</b>绝缘包扎、标识</p>\n          <p><b>用法：</b>缠绕在导线接头处，起到绝缘和保护作用。</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"tool-card\">\n        <div class=\"tool-heading\"><span class=\"number\">12</span><span>热缩管</span></div>\n        <div class=\"product tubes\" aria-label=\"热缩管图片\">[工具图片]</div>\n        <div class=\"tool-text\">\n          <p><b>用途：</b>绝缘保护</p>\n          <p><b>用法：</b>套在导线接头处，用热风枪加热收缩即可。</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"tool-card\">\n        <div class=\"tool-heading\"><span class=\"number\">13</span><span>电烙铁</span></div>\n        <div class=\"product\" aria-label=\"电烙铁图片\">[工具图片]</div>\n        <div class=\"tool-text\">\n          <p><b>用途：</b>焊接导线、元器件</p>\n          <p><b>用法：</b>通电加热后，配合焊锡进行焊接，使用后注意及时清理烙头。</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"tool-card\">\n        <div class=\"tool-heading\"><span class=\"number\">14</span><span>焊锡丝</span></div>\n        <div class=\"product reel\" aria-label=\"焊锡丝图片\">[工具图片]</div>\n        <div class=\"tool-text\">\n          <p><b>用途：</b>配合电烙铁焊接</p>\n          <p><b>用法：</b>用于填充焊点，使焊点牢固导电良好。</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"tool-card\">\n        <div class=\"tool-heading\"><span class=\"number\">15</span><span>吸锡器</span></div>\n        <div class=\"product\" aria-label=\"吸锡器图片\">[工具图片]</div>\n        <div class=\"tool-text\">\n          <p><b>用途：</b>吸除多余焊锡</p>\n          <p><b>用法：</b>将吸锡器对准焊点，按下按钮即可吸走焊锡。</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"tool-card\">\n        <div class=\"tool-heading\"><span class=\"number\">16</span><span>电钻</span></div>\n        <div class=\"product drill\" aria-label=\"电钻图片\">[工具图片]</div>\n        <div class=\"tool-text\">\n          <p><b>用途：</b>钻孔、安装</p>\n          <p><b>用法：</b>安装合适钻头，对准位置后启动电钻进行钻孔。</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"tool-card\">\n        <div class=\"tool-heading\"><span class=\"number\">17</span><span>冲击钻头</span></div>\n        <div class=\"product bits\" aria-label=\"冲击钻头图片\">[工具图片]</div>\n        <div class=\"tool-text\">\n          <p><b>用途：</b>在墙体、混凝土上钻孔</p>\n          <p><b>用法：</b>配合冲击钻使用，选择合适直径钻头。</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"tool-card\">\n        <div class=\"tool-heading\"><span class=\"number\">18</span><span>内六角扳手</span></div>\n        <div class=\"product keys\" aria-label=\"内六角扳手图片\">[工具图片]</div>\n        <div class=\"tool-text\">\n          <p><b>用途：</b>拧内六角螺丝</p>\n          <p><b>用法：</b>选择合适尺寸，插入螺丝孔中旋转拧紧或松开。</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"tutorial-section\">\n    <div class=\"section-ribbon\">电工工具使用小教程</div>\n    <div class=\"tutorial-grid\">\n      <article class=\"tutorial-card\">\n        <h2 class=\"tutorial-title\">1. 测电笔使用</h2>\n        <div class=\"tutorial-image\" aria-label=\"测电笔使用操作图片\"></div>\n        <p class=\"tutorial-text\">手指接触笔尾金属，笔尖接触插孔，氖管亮表示该孔为火线。</p>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"tutorial-card\">\n        <h2 class=\"tutorial-title\">2. 剥线钳使用</h2>\n        <div class=\"tutorial-image\" aria-label=\"剥线钳使用操作图片\"></div>\n        <p class=\"tutorial-text\">将导线放入对应线号的剥线口，轻压旋转即可剥离绝缘层。</p>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"tutorial-card\">\n        <h2 class=\"tutorial-title\">3. 万用表测电压</h2>\n        <div class=\"tutorial-image\" aria-label=\"万用表测电压操作图片\"></div>\n        <p class=\"tutorial-text\">调至交流电压档，将表笔分别接触火线和零线，读数即为电压值。</p>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"tutorial-card\">\n        <h2 class=\"tutorial-title\">4. 电烙铁焊接</h2>\n        <div class=\"tutorial-image\" aria-label=\"电烙铁焊接操作图片\"></div>\n        <p class=\"tutorial-text\">电烙铁加热后，先加热焊点，再送入焊锡丝，待焊锡融化后移开焊锡丝。</p>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"tutorial-card\">\n        <h2 class=\"tutorial-title\">5. 绝缘胶带包扎</h2>\n        <div class=\"tutorial-image\" aria-label=\"绝缘胶带包扎操作图片\"></div>\n        <p class=\"tutorial-text\">将胶带拉紧缠绕在接头处，覆盖所有裸露导体，确保绝缘可靠。</p>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"tutorial-card\">\n        <h2 class=\"tutorial-title\">6. 热缩管使用</h2>\n        <div class=\"tutorial-image\" aria-label=\"热缩管使用操作图片\"></div>\n        <p class=\"tutorial-text\">将热缩管套在接头处，用热风枪加热均匀，直至完全收缩贴合。</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <footer class=\"safety\">\n    <div class=\"safety-sign\">\n      <div class=\"warning-triangle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n      <span>安全使用提示</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"safety-list\">\n      <div class=\"safety-item\"><span class=\"safety-number\">1</span><span>施工前务必断电，确认无电再操作。</span></div>\n      <div class=\"safety-item\"><span class=\"safety-number\">2</span><span>使用测电笔、万用表前先确认工具完好。</span></div>\n      <div class=\"safety-item\"><span class=\"safety-number\">3</span><span>工具使用后及时整理，避免遗失或损坏。</span></div>\n      <div class=\"safety-item\"><span class=\"safety-number\">4</span><span>电工刀使用时刀口朝外，避免划伤。</span></div>\n      <div class=\"safety-item\"><span class=\"safety-number\">5</span><span>高处作业注意安全，佩戴安全带。</span></div>\n      <div class=\"safety-item\"><span class=\"safety-number\">6</span><span>非专业人员请勿带电操作，确保人身安全。</span></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"safety-logo\">\n      <div class=\"helmet\" aria-label=\"安全帽图示\"></div>\n      <div class=\"shield\" aria-label=\"安全盾牌图示\"></div>\n      <div class=\"logo-text\">安全第一<br>规范操作</div>\n      <div class=\"brand\">北区教育</div>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n</main>\n<div class=\"edge-mark\">[illegible]</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
